{"udi kule rujivahoH": [{"id": "udi kUle rujivahoH", "headword": "उदि कूले रुजिवहोः", "headword_slp1": "udi kUle rujivahoH", "fold": "udi kule rujivahoH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix खश् comes after the verbs रुजि 'to break into pieces' and वह् 'to carry', when preceded by the उपसर्ग उत् and the word कूल 'bank' is in composition with them as the object.\n\nTerms: खश्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदि कूले रुजिवहोः ३.२.३१", "३.२.३१", "३.२.३१ उदि कूले रुजिवहोः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udi kUle rujivahoH ३.२.३१", "३.२.३१", "३.२.३१ udi kUle rujivahoH"]}], "udi grahaH": [{"id": "udi grahaH", "headword": "उदि ग्रहः", "headword_slp1": "udi grahaH", "fold": "udi grahaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix घञ् comes after the verb ग्रह् 'to seize' when the preposition उत् is in composition.\n\nTerms: घञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदि ग्रहः ३.३.३५", "३.३.३५", "३.३.३५ उदि ग्रहः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udi grahaH ३.३.३५", "३.३.३५", "३.३.३५ udi grahaH"]}], "udi srayatiyOtipudruvaH": [{"id": "udi SrayatiyOtipUdruvaH", "headword": "उदि श्रयतियौतिपूद्रुवः", "headword_slp1": "udi SrayatiyOtipUdruvaH", "fold": "udi srayatiyOtipudruvaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix घञ् comes after the verbs 1. श्रि 2. यु 'to join' 3. पू 'to purify' 4. द्रु 'to run' when the preposition उत् is in composition.\n\nTerms: घञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदि श्रयतियौतिपूद्रुवः ३.३.४९", "३.३.४९", "३.३.४९ उदि श्रयतियौतिपूद्रुवः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udi SrayatiyOtipUdruvaH ३.३.४९", "३.३.४९", "३.३.४९ udi SrayatiyOtipUdruvaH"]}], "udican maNo vyatihare": [{"id": "udIcAM mANo vyatIhAre", "headword": "उदीचां माङो व्यतीहारे", "headword_slp1": "udIcAM mANo vyatIhAre", "fold": "udican maNo vyatihare", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "According to the opinion of the Eastern Grammarians, the affix क्त्वा is added to the root मेन् 'to exchange' when the sense is that of interchange, (though the action denoted by the former word is not prior to the action denoted by the latter word).\n\nTerms: क्त्वा", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदीचां माङो व्यतीहारे ३.४.१९", "३.४.१९", "३.४.१९ उदीचां माङो व्यतीहारे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udIcAM mANo vyatIhAre ३.४.१९", "३.४.१९", "३.४.१९ udIcAM mANo vyatIhAre"]}], "udicamiY": [{"id": "udIcAmiY", "headword": "उदीचामिञ्", "headword_slp1": "udIcAmiY", "fold": "udicamiY", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "According to the opinion of Northern Grammarians, the affix इञ् comes in the sense of descendant after the words ending in सेना , the word लक्षण and words expressing artisans.\n\nTerms: इञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदीचामिञ् ४.१.१५३", "४.१.१५३", "४.१.१५३ उदीचामिञ्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udIcAmiY ४.१.१५३", "४.१.१५३", "४.१.१५३ udIcAmiY"]}], "udican vfdDadagotrat‌": [{"id": "udIcAM vfdDAdagotrAt‌", "headword": "उदीचां वृद्धादगोत्रात्‌", "headword_slp1": "udIcAM vfdDAdagotrAt‌", "fold": "udican vfdDadagotrat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "According to the opinion of Northern Grammarians after the words with वृद्धि in the first syllable when it is not a गोत्र -name, the affix फिञ् is used in the sense of a descendant.\n\nTerms: फिञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["उदीचां वृद्धादगोत्रात्‌ ४.१.१५७", "४.१.१५७", "४.१.१५७ उदीचां वृद्धादगोत्रात्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["udIcAM vfdDAdagotrAt‌ ४.१.१५७", "४.१.१५७", "४.१.१५७ udIcAM vfdDAdagotrAt‌"]}], "udicyagramaca bahvacontodatat‌": [{"id": "udIcyagrAmAcca bahvaco'ntodAttAt‌", "headword": "उदीच्यग्रामाच्च बह्वचोऽन्तोदात्तात्‌", "headword_slp1": "udIcyagrAmAcca bahvaco'ntodAttAt‌", "fold": "udicyagramaca bahvacontodatat‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix 